85
00:03:38.830 --> 00:03:40.420
This is the same problem we had up here,

86
00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:43.280
except now we're doing division instead of multiplication.

87
00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:44.800
So we know that the improper fractions

88
00:03:44.800 --> 00:03:45.633
are going to be the same.

89
00:03:45.633 --> 00:03:47.590
So here I'm going to have 9/2, remember,

90
00:03:47.590 --> 00:03:50.100
two times four is eight, eight plus one is nine,

91
00:03:50.100 --> 00:03:52.260
nine over the original denominator of two.

92
00:03:52.260 --> 00:03:57.260
So 9/2 divided by, remember, 23/4.

93
00:03:57.590 --> 00:03:59.420
And now, instead of doing division,

94
00:03:59.420 --> 00:04:02.170
what I know about dividing fractions is that

95
00:04:02.170 --> 00:04:05.060
