123
00:05:14.544 --> 00:05:16.940
And now I can just multiply across my numerators.

124
00:05:16.940 --> 00:05:19.040
Nine times five is 45.

125
00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:21.820
And four times six is 24.

126
00:05:21.820 --> 00:05:23.230
I can divide both the numerator

127
00:05:23.230 --> 00:05:24.890
